tatus":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1111519003:0":{"text":"알겠어!","source_cn":"知道了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x319E0B217B809E5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1111519004:0":{"text":"그래서, 이 아이의 뒤에 평생 숨어 있기라도 할 생각인가?","source_cn":"所以，你们最终决定在那个孩子边上躲一辈子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9A6BF2670048DBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1111519005:0":{"text":"아니거든요! 우린 당신을 물리치려고 왔다고요!","source_cn":"才不会呢！我们要打败你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF66C25D91BB6520B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1111519006:0":{"text":"어째서 나에게 그런 적개심을 품고 있지? 나, 플루스토는 세상 사람들에게 행복을 줄 수 있는 악마인 것을.","source_cn":"为何要对我充满敌意呢？我，普鲁斯托，是可以让世人获得幸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43E7D5327140F0F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1111519007:0":{"text":"나의 환상 속이라면 죽은 가족이 두 팔을 벌려 너희를 안아줄 것이고, ","source_cn":"在我的幻术中，逝去的至亲会再次展开双臂，给予拥抱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D3774D1A7BB87B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","do